    "Drag vertically, or increment and decrement in ten-point steps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下拖动，或以 10 点为步长增减。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each source app keeps one of ten deterministic shades, so its cards stay recognizable without drifting too far from your chosen color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个来源 App 固定使用十种深浅之一，卡片容易辨认，又不会偏离你选的颜色太远。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
