    "Pesty will not save anything copied while one of these apps is frontmost. Copies made from a browser extension are attributed to the browser, so add that too if you use one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些 App 位于最前面时，Pesty 不会保存任何拷贝的内容。浏览器扩展里的拷贝会被算作浏览器本身，如果你用扩展，请把浏览器也加进来。"
