    "Sign in to iCloud and enable iCloud Drive in System Settings to sync your clipboard across your Macs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置”中登录 iCloud 并开启 iCloud 云盘，以便在多台 Mac 之间同步剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to iCloud and enable iCloud Drive to use sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录 iCloud 并开启 iCloud 云盘后才能同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skips the five-minute Undo window: deleted clips are removed at once and cannot be recovered. Hold Option while deleting to skip Undo for one deletion, whatever this setting says.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过五分钟的撤销期：删除的片段会立即移除，无法恢复。不管此设置如何，删除时按住 Option 都可以让这一次删除跳过撤销期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
